  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conflict Sensitivity Consultancy for the Dutch Embassy in South Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dutch Embassy and their implementing partners</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project entails working closely with implementing organisations (clients) on the ground in South Sudan to develop and deliver a comprehensive and tailored conflict sensitivity accompaniment programme. The clients receive one-to-one guidance from Alert Conflict Sensitivity experts and have developed conflict sensitivity action and integration plans for their organisation&#xe2;&#x20ac;&#x2122;s strategies and operations.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To design, adapt and advise on clients&#xe2;&#x20ac;&#x2122; conflict sensitivity plan and programmes</narrative>
  </description>
